<p>premia on dollar at the following rates (in paise):</p>
<p>	     Cash Spot	Cash Tom	 Tom Spot</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  TIME	Bid/Ask	  Bid/Ask	 Bid/Ask</p>
<p>(in IST)</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> 1030	0100/0125     0075/0100     00125/0025</p>
