<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Aug   Sep    Oct    Nov    Dec    Jan    Feb    Mar</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> 1030    6/7  16/17  27/28  38/39  52/53  66/67  76/78  88/90</p>
<p> 1100    6/7  16/17  28/29  38/39  52/53  65/66  78/79  88/90</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>These indicative rates are based o1n contributions from ABN AMRO,  ANZ Grindlays, Andhra Bank, Bank of America, Banque Nationale De Paris,Barclays  Bank Ltd,Canara Bank,Citibank,Credit Lyonnais, Deutsche Bank, Dresdner  Bank, Global Trust Bank, HDFC Bank, Hongkong Bank, L.C.Raheja, Mashreq  Bank,Nucleus Securities, Societe Generale, Standard Chartered Bank,  State Bank of India - Calcutta, Syndicate Bank.</p>
